WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.801
Step six. The yield sweep, and your monthly payment.

2
00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:09.803
A countdown shows the next sweep. One demo month lasts five minutes.

3
00:00:09.803 --> 00:00:18.106
When it reaches zero, anyone can tap Trigger sweep now, and earn a small tip. If nobody does, the keeper does it within a minute.

4
00:00:18.106 --> 00:00:25.838
That month's yield went to the lender as extra principal, so your loan balance went down.

5
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:33.586
You still make your monthly payment. Tap Make a payment. It covers interest and principal, and goes straight to the lender.

6
00:00:33.586 --> 00:00:39.947
Payment recorded. Sweeps and payments together shorten the loan. The figures are illustrative.

